wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_plugin_attribute(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(1075241865216196921)
,p_plugin_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(1075232931295249171)
,p_attribute_scope=>'COMPONENT'
,p_attribute_sequence=>10
,p_display_sequence=>100
,p_prompt=>'Blacklist Icons and Categories'
,p_attribute_type=>'TEXTAREA'
,p_is_required=>false
,p_supported_component_types=>'APEX_APPLICATION_PAGE_ITEMS:APEX_APPL_PAGE_IG_COLUMNS'
,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'Hide icons from the picker. One entry per line, or comma separated.<br><br>',
'An entry can be any of:',
'<ul>',
'<li><strong>fa-bomb</strong> - an icon class name</li>',
'<li><strong>bomb</strong> - the same, the fa- prefix is optional</li>',
'<li><strong>COUNTRY_FLAG</strong> - a whole category, as named on its tab</li>',
'<li><strong>Country Flag</strong> - the same, spaces and letter case are ignored</li>',
'<li><strong>fa-flag-*</strong> - a wildcard, hides every icon that matches</li>',
'</ul>',
'For example:',
'<pre>fa-bomb, fa-skull',
'COUNTRY_FLAG',
'fa-flag-*</pre>',
'A category that ends up empty disappears from the tabs as well as the grid.<br><br>',
'An icon already stored in a row <strong>keeps rendering normally</strong> - blacklisting ',
'only removes it from the picker, so it cannot be chosen again. Existing data is never ',
'changed.<br><br>',
'<strong>Category names you can use:</strong><br>',
'NEW, ACCESSIBILITY, AI, BUSINESS, CALENDAR, CHART, CONSTRUCTION, COUNTRY_FLAG, CURRENCY, DIRECTIONAL, EMOJI, FILE_TYPE, FORM_CONTROL, GENDER, HAND, MAPS, MEDICAL, NUMBERS, PAYMENT, SPINNER, TEXT_EDITOR, TRANSPORTATION, VIDEO_PLAYER, WEB_APPLICATION<b'
||'r><br>',
'Icon names are the Font APEX class names - open the picker and turn on ',
'<strong>Show Icon Labels</strong> to read them, or hover any icon for its tooltip.<br>',
'<br>',
'This list applies to this item only, <strong>on top of</strong> the application ',
'wide list under Shared Components, Plug-ins, IconPicker. Both lists always apply; ',
'an item cannot re-enable something the application has blacklisted.'))
);
end;
/
